We can export the validation functions and use that with a manual stub. But the changes will open up the API surface that needs to be supported. Let me know if this is a feasible option.

', 'created_at': '2026-07-17T16:38:48+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/zz_generated.validations.go', 'position': 1}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': "> But the changes will open up the API surface that needs to be supported. 

