", 'created_at': '2026-07-17T19:41:19+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/api/resource/v1/validation/doc.go', 'position': 1}, {'user': 'yongruilin', 'body': "Is putting it to the standalone package necessary? I'm thinking just put it under resource/v1 ? https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/140188/changes#diff-05d11b35bddd12d46592ae57d0beaabe6ffd7bb14390597f53231d594819fc03 is also trying to do the similar.", 'created_at': '2026-07-17T19:55:46+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/api/resource/v1/validation/doc.go', 'position': 1}, {'user': 'alaypatel07', 'body': '+1, no reason why we cant use resource/v1, moved it to there instead of adding a new package.', 'created_at': '2026-07-17T21:29:50+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/api/resource/v1/validation/doc.go', 'position': 1}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': 'I think we need both `+optional` and `+k8s:optional`: one is for OpenAPI, the other for validation.
', 'created_at': '2026-07-18T07:19:19+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/types.go', 'position': 6}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': 'Same here.', 'created_at': '2026-07-18T07:19:30+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/types.go', 'position': 14}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': 'Add `+required`', 'created_at': '2026-07-18T07:19:45+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/types.go', 'position': 24}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': 'Add `+optional`.', 'created_at': '2026-07-18T07:19:55+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/types.go', 'position': 30}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': '`+required`.', 'created_at': '2026-07-18T07:20:18+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/types.go', 'position': 40}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': '`+required`', 'created_at': '2026-07-18T07:20:27+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/types.go', 'position': 50}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': '`+required`', 'created_at': '2026-07-18T07:20:34+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/types.go', 'position': 58}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': '`+optional`.', 'created_at': '2026-07-18T07:20:45+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/types.go', 'position': 67}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': '`+optional`', 'created_at': '2026-07-18T07:20:52+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/types.go', 'position': 79}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': 'Thanks @yongruilin for the guidance!', 'created_at': '2026-07-18T07:21:43+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/zz_generated.validations.go', 'position': 1}, {'user': 'alaypatel07', 'body': 'My understanding was that this is lagecy and not used anymore for metadata API. Can you help me understand where it will be used?', 'created_at': '2026-07-18T15:06:27+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/types.go', 'position': 6}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': "If someone were to generate OpenAPI docs or schema for this, then they would depend on `+optional/+required`. There is also a linter which checks for it. I'm not sure why it's not triggering, perhaps because the package is exempt. 

