', 'created_at': '2026-07-19T10:10:48+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/validation.go', 'position': 1}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': "I'm going to add this as a follow-up while updating the graduation PR (https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/139066/changes#r3610313852).

Not a blocker for this PR.", 'created_at': '2026-07-19T10:23:54+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/validation.go', 'position': 1}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': 'Ooops! Trying to use these generated functions made me realize that we have a conceptual flaw: *producers* use the versioned APIs, but *consumers*, the ones which need to validate potentially untrusted input, use the unversioned API. For that we currently have no validation...

That needs to be added here in this PR. We can keep the versioned validation, producers can use it to verify that they are not writing something invalid.', 'created_at': '2026-07-19T11:08:23+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/validation.go', 'position': 1}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': 'This is not used in-tree, which has instead `pkg/apis/resource/v1/zz_generated.validations.go:func Validate_ResourceSliceSpec(`. This is not wrong, just a bit redundant. Not a blocker.

@yongruilin: can this be avoided?
', 'created_at': '2026-07-19T11:13:59+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/api/resource/v1/zz_generated.validations.go', 'position': 2613}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': "`DecodeMetadataFromStream` has the versioned object. That is where we can do versioned validation. It's better than generating validation for the unversioned API and using that because the versioned validation produces errors with the right field names. It's also less work and code.


", 'created_at': '2026-07-19T11:49:42+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/validation.go', 'position': 1}, {'user': 'pohly', 'body': 'Implemented in https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/140722, nothing to do here in this PR.', 'created_at': '2026-07-19T13:48:09+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/validation.go', 'position': 1}, {'user': 'alaypatel07', 'body': 'Applied this patch, thanks!', 'created_at': '2026-07-19T14:54:03+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/dynamic-resource-allocation/api/metadata/v1alpha1/types.go', 'position': 6}]

