However the semantics for this are not clear which is why I decided to explicitly forget the previous placements every time. But I don't have a strong opinion either way.", 'created_at': '2026-07-17T08:23:05+00:00', 'path': 'pkg/scheduler/schedule_one_podgroup.go', 'position': 1}, {'user': 'brejman', 'body': 'QueuedPodInfo is needed for AssumeAndReserve/UnreserveAndForget. To assume the subtree we need QueuedPodInfo objects in the results.', 'created_at': '2026-07-17T08:26:17+00:00', 'path': 'pkg/scheduler/schedule_one_podgroup.go', 'position': 14}, {'user': 'brejman', 'body': 'Side note, we should be able to get rid of the QueuedPodInfo dependency in the scheduling algorithm core, but not in this PR (and not in this release). You can see the proposal in https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/scheduler-library/blob/29eb2fd70e1de8db68729ab98bba55ea3c8e8aae/pkg/upstreamsync/scheduler.go#L136', 'created_at': '2026-07-17T08:29:39+00:00', 'path': 'pkg/scheduler/schedule_one_podgroup.go', 'position': 14}, {'user': 'brejman', 'body': 'CPG has dependency on TAS here: https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/d36460703bc7febccb44dc30e963ecbae38f6563/pkg/features/kube_features.go#L2318

