ot needed because we don't run per-pod PostFilters. ", 'created_at': '2026-07-20T14:57:33+00:00', 'path': 'pkg/scheduler/schedule_one_podgroup.go', 'position': 1}, {'user': 'mm4tt', 'body': "Given we do that and just return result, what's the point in anyResult being `map[fwk.EntityKey]*podGroupAlgorithmResult` instead of just `*podGroupAlgorithmResult` and having:

