To retain the info in the comment that an option can be enabled even when the corresponding feature gate is disabled.', 'created_at': '2026-07-13T20:20:00+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/apimachinery/pkg/api/operation/operation.go', 'position': 1}, {'user': 'jpbetz', 'body': "Because the strategy's options are appended after the caller-supplied configs, a test that passes its own `WithOptions(...)` gets silently overridden here (the config loop is last-write-wins). No callers do that today, but `WithOptions` is exported, so I *think* it'd be less surprising to only fall back to the strategy's options when the caller didn't supply any. Same for below update case.", 'created_at': '2026-07-13T20:20:00+00:00', 'path': 'pkg/api/testing/validation.go', 'position': 1}, {'user': 'jpbetz', 'body': "Unless I'm misreadin, nothing sets `Conditions.OptionEnabled`/`OptionDisabled` today (`WithConditions` has no callers), so this path isn't exercised by any output test.  Could we add a test for this path?", 'created_at': '2026-07-13T20:20:00+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/code-generator/cmd/validation-gen/validation.go', 'position': 14}, {'user': 'yongruilin', 'body': 'Updated.', 'created_at': '2026-07-13T21:48:23+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/apimachinery/pkg/api/validate/enum.go', 'position': 68}, {'user': 'yongruilin', 'body': 'Updated.', 'created_at': '2026-07-13T21:48:30+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/apimachinery/pkg/api/operation/operation.go', 'position': 1}, {'user': 'yongruilin', 'body': 'Good catch! Updated.', 'created_at': '2026-07-13T21:48:40+00:00', 'path': 'pkg/api/testing/validation.go', 'position': 1}, {'user': 'yongruilin', 'body': "The usage was dropped in [jpbetz/validation-gen#150](https://github.com/jpbetz/validation-gen/pull/150/changes#diff-c199bcb5778e061a71141a130a7810f8fac5748fbb709283c764c6d83b636e9fL64-L66), so `WithConditions` is now orphaned. It is a bit hard to test: output tests are tag-driven, so with no tag emitting `Conditions` there's no way to generate code that reaches this branch — a real test would mean re-adding a tag to wire it. 

I only updated it to match the new `HasOption` signature. I would prefer to have a `// TODO: no tag emits Conditions yet; add coverage when one does`.", 'created_at': '2026-07-13T22:24:34+00:00', 'path': 'staging/src/k8s.io/code-generator/cmd/validation-gen/validation.go', 'position': 14}]

